msgstr "ធម្មតា"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1829
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid "This lets the clock appear as a simple text that shows the time in plain text."
msgstr "a អ៊ិន្ឈ៍ ធម្មតា."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:1836
#, no-c-format
