"In the <guilabel>Display</guilabel> section you can check if you want to have "
"the date and/or the seconds shown. In <guilabel>Time</guilabel> "
"you can choose if you want the common &kde; look or your own custom colors and "
"font."
msgstr "ក្នុង<guilabel> បង្ហាញ</guilabel> ដល់ កាល​បរិច្ឆេទ និង ឬ វិនាទី ក្នុង<guilabel> ពេលវេលា</guilabel>&kde; ឬ និង."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:1955
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid "The <guilabel>Digital Clock</guilabel> options"
msgstr "<guilabel> នាឡិកា</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1957
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In the <guilabel>Display</guilabel> section you can check if you want to have "
"the date, the seconds and/or blinking dots shown. In <guilabel>Time</guilabel> "
"you can choose if you want the common <acronym>LCD</acronym>"
"-Look or your own custom colors."
msgstr "ក្នុង<guilabel> បង្ហាញ</guilabel> ដល់ កាល​បរិច្ឆេទ វិនាទី និង ឬ ក្នុង<guilabel> ពេលវេលា</guilabel><acronym></acronym> រូបរាង ឬ."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:1966
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid "The <guilabel>Analog Clock</guilabel> options"
msgstr "<guilabel> នាឡិកា</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1968
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In the <guilabel>Display</guilabel> section you can check if you want to have "
"the date and/or seconds shown. In <guilabel>Time</guilabel> "
"you can choose if you want the common <acronym>LCD</acronym>"
"-Look or your own custom colors. You can also set the level of antialiasing, "
"which means that lines will get blurred a little bit to prevent steps in the "
"drawing. High quality antialiasing may catch some system load on low-end "
"systems."
msgstr "ក្នុង<guilabel> បង្ហាញ</guilabel> ដល់ កាល​បរិច្ឆេទ និង ឬ វិនាទី ក្នុង<guilabel> ពេលវេលា</guilabel><acronym></acronym> រូបរាង ឬ អ្នក a ដល់ អ៊ិន្ឈ៍ ខ្ពស់."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:1981
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid "The <guilabel>Fuzzy Clock</guilabel> options"
msgstr "<guilabel> នាឡិកា</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1983
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In the <guilabel>Display</guilabel> section you can check if you want to have "
"the date shown. In <guilabel>Time</guilabel> you can choose the colors and the "
"font of the fuzzy clock. There is also a slider to set the <guilabel>"
"Fuzziness</guilabel>. This cannot be described in the documents, just do your "
"own experiments."
msgstr "ក្នុង<guilabel> បង្ហាញ</guilabel> ដល់ កាល​បរិច្ឆេទ ក្នុង<guilabel> ពេលវេលា</guilabel> និង ជា a ដល់<guilabel></guilabel> អ៊ិន្ឈ៍ ឯកសារ."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2000
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Quick Launcher Applet"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2002
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This is a compressed application launcher. It is very useful especially if the "
"panel is set to normal or large size. You can add applications by drag and drop "
"or from the context menu. The context menu is also used to remove an "
"application."
msgstr "ជា a កម្មវិធី​ ជា បន្ទះ  ជា ដល់ normal ឬ អ្នក និង ឬ ជា ដល់ កម្មវិធី​."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2011
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid "The System Tray Applet"
msgstr "ប្រព័ន្ធ"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2013
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The System Tray is used to dock some special applications &eg; &klipper; or "
"&juk;. The applications shown in the system tray all provide individual "
"funtionality. If you need help concerning these options, please refer to the "
"application handbooks."
msgstr "ប្រព័ន្ធ ជា ដល់&eg;&klipper; ឬ&juk; អ៊ិន្ឈ៍ ទាំងអស់ ដល់ កម្មវិធី​."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2020
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The System Tray's context menu provides the option <guimenuitem>"
"Configure System Tray...</guimenuitem> . If you click on it, a dialog pops up "
"which lets you choose applications that should not be permanently visible in "
"the System Tray. Hidden icons can be made visible by clicking on the small "
"arrow appearing on the left or top side of the applet."
msgstr "ប្រព័ន្ធ វិ.<guimenuitem> កំណត់​រចនាសម្ព័ន្ធ ប្រព័ន្ធ</guimenuitem> a អាចមើលឃើញ អ៊ិន្ឈ៍ ប្រព័ន្ធ ដែល​បាន​​លាក់ រូប​តំណាង អាចមើលឃើញ ឬ."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2031
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid "Lock/Logout Applet"
msgstr "ចាក់​សោ ចេញ"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2032
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This little applet contains two buttons. The <guibutton>"
"Lock the session</guibutton> is used to lock the session if you ever want to "
"leave your &kde; unattended and don't want anybody to access it. The <guibutton>"
"Log out</guibutton> is used to close your &kde; session."
msgstr "មាន ពីរ<guibutton> ចាក់​សោ</guibutton> ជា ដល់ ដល់&kde; និង ដល់<guibutton> កំណត់ហេតុ</guibutton> ជា ដល់&kde;."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2041
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Application Launcher Applet"
msgstr "កម្មវិធី"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2043
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This applet provides a simple command line embedded in &kicker;. Nothing more, "
"nothing less."
msgstr "a បន្ទាត់​ អ៊ិន្ឈ៍&kicker; គ្មាន​អ្វី​."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2051
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Runaway Process Catcher Applet"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2053
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This applet shows a smiley which will get angry when any process catches up too "
"much system resources. If an application uses too much, a messagebox will "
"appear and ask you how to handle that application."
msgstr "a កម្មវិធី​ a និង ដល់ កម្មវិធី​."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2059
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Clicking it with the &LMB; will show a configuration dialog. Here you can set "
"the <guilabel>Update interval</guilabel>, which is set in seconds, and the "
"<guilabel>CPU load threshold</guilabel>. At the moment, there is no real advice "
"for setting this up, you will have to do some experimenting. These settings "
"will probably change in a future release. There is also a section <guilabel>"
"Programs to ignore</guilabel> where you can add applications that use many "
"resources naturally, &eg; compilers or 3D renderers."
msgstr "&LMB; a<guilabel> ធ្វើ​ឲ្យ​ទាន់​សម័យ</guilabel> ជា អ៊ិន្ឈ៍ វិនាទី និង<guilabel> ស៊ីភីយូ</guilabel> ជា ទេ សម្រាប់ ដល់ អ៊ិន្ឈ៍ a អនាគត​កាល ចេញ​ផ្សាយ ជា a<guilabel> កម្មវិធី ដល់</guilabel>&eg; ឬ."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2073
#, no-c-format
msgid "&klipper; Applet"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2075
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This applet does exactly the same like the &klipper; residing in the system "
"tray. It has the advantage, that it consumes a little bit less system "
"resources, which only matters on really slow systems, but has the disadvantage, "
"that it uses more space than &klipper; in the system tray. You can read more "
"about that in the manual for <ulink url=\"help:/klipper/index.html\">"
"&klipper;</ulink>."
msgstr "&klipper; អ៊ិន្ឈ៍ a&klipper; អ៊ិន្ឈ៍ អ្នក អ៊ិន្ឈ៍ ធ្វើ​ដោយ​ដៃ សម្រាប់<ulink url=\"help:/klipper/index.html\">&klipper;</ulink>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2088
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid "Panel Extensions"
msgstr "បន្ទះ ផ្នែក​បន្ថែម"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2090
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"There are also some features that run outside of &kicker;, the extensions. They "
"are added from the context menu by choosing <guisubmenu>"
"Add New Panel</guisubmenu>. You can move them to any screenborder by dragging "
"them at the small applet handle on their side and remove it by right clicking "
"on an empty space and choose <guimenuitem>Remove Panel</guimenuitem>."
msgstr "&kicker;<guisubmenu> បន្ថែម ថ្មី បន្ទះ</guisubmenu> អ្នក ដល់ នៅ និង ទទេ និង<guimenuitem> យកចេញ បន្ទះ</guimenuitem>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2098
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The style of the extensions can be configured in the <xref "
"linkend=\"panel-extensions\"/> section of &kicker;'s preferences."
msgstr "អ៊ិន្ឈ៍<xref linkend=\"panel-extensions\"/>&kicker; វិ.."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2105
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid "The External Taskbar Panel Extension"
msgstr "របារ​ភារកិច្ច បន្ទះ កន្ទុយ"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2107
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The external taskbar is just the same as the taskbar applet with the only "
"difference that it provides its own panel. Refer to the <link "
"linkend=\"taskbar-applet\">taskbar applet section</link> for help about it."
msgstr "ជា បន្ទះ  ដល់<link linkend=\"taskbar-applet\"></link> សម្រាប់."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2117
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Child Panel Extension"
msgstr "បន្ទះ កន្ទុយ"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2119
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This is just a panel like &kicker; itself, where you can add all the stuff "
"&kicker; is also capable. So you can have as many &kicker;s as you want. Just "
"add a child panel and add applications and applets to it."
msgstr "ជា a បន្ទះ &kicker; ទាំងអស់&kicker; ជា&kicker; វិ. a បន្ទះ  និង និង ដល់."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2128
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid "The <application>KasBar</application> Extension"
msgstr "<application></application> កន្ទុយ"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2130
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The <application>KasBar</application> is an iconic replacement of the taskbar. "
"It always shows the icons of all currently running applications on any desktop, "
"they can be chosen by clicking with the &LMB;. The active window is "
"highlighted, minimized windows will show a little triangle pointing downwards "
"instead of the square in the lower right of the icons. A triangle pointing to "
"the right indicates that the application is shaded."
msgstr "<application></application> ជា រូប​តំណាង ទាំងអស់&LMB; សកម្ម ជា a ត្រីកោណ  អ៊ិន្ឈ៍ រូប​តំណាង A ត្រីកោណ  ដល់ កម្មវិធី​ ជា."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2142
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Dock Application Bar Extension"
msgstr "ចូលផែ កម្មវិធី របារ កន្ទុយ"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2144
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Dock Application Bar is an external bar which lets WindowMaker applications "
"be docked. Just run your dockable WindowMaker programs, if the Dock Application "
"Bar is running, they will be automatically docked."
msgstr "ចូលផែ កម្មវិធី របារ ជា កម្មវិធី ចូលផែ កម្មវិធី របារ ជា."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2154
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid "Command Reference"
msgstr "សេចក្តីយោង​ពាក្យ​បញ្ជា​"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2157
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Panel"
msgstr "បន្ទះ"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2159
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid "There is only one standard shortcut available in &kicker;:"
msgstr "ជា មួយ អ៊ិន្ឈ៍&kicker;:"

#. Tag: keycombo
#: index.docbook:2165
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid "&Alt;<keycap>F1</keycap>"
msgstr "&Alt;<keycap> F1</keycap>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2167
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid "Opens the <guimenu>K</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr "<guimenu> K</guimenu> ម៉ឺនុយ"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2179
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid "Questions and Answers"
msgstr "សំណួរ​ និង​ចម្លើយ​"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2184
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid "How can I add applications, applets or anything else to the panel?"
msgstr "I ឬ អ្វី​ទាំងអស់ ដល់ បន្ទះ ?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2189
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Click the &RMB; on any free space in &kicker; and choose what you want to add. "
"See in <link linkend=\"basics\">&kicker; Basics</link> for more about that."
msgstr "ចុច&RMB; អ៊ិន្ឈ៍&kicker; និង ដល់ អ៊ិន្ឈ៍<link linkend=\"basics\">&kicker;</link> សម្រាប់."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2199
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid "Can I have an external Taskbar just like in &kde; 1?"
msgstr "I របារ​ភារកិច្ច អ៊ិន្ឈ៍&kde;?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2204
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Yes, you can just click the &RMB; on any empty space in &kicker; and then "
"choose <guisubmenu>Add</guisubmenu>, <guisubmenu>Panel</guisubmenu> "
"and the <guimenuitem>External Taskbar</guimenuitem>."
msgstr "បាទ/ចាស&RMB; ទទេ អ៊ិន្ឈ៍&kicker; និង<guisubmenu> បន្ថែម</guisubmenu><guisubmenu> បន្ទះ</guisubmenu> និង<guimenuitem> របារ​ភារកិច្ច</guimenuitem>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2215
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid "How can I move &kicker; to another screen border?"
msgstr "I&kicker; ដល់?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2221
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Simply drag it by holding the &LMB; on any empty space in &kicker; to any "
"screen border."
msgstr "&LMB; ទទេ អ៊ិន្ឈ៍&kicker; ដល់."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2230
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid "How can I move extensions to another screen border?"
msgstr "I ដល់?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2236
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Just drag them by holding the &LMB; on the small <guibutton>handles</guibutton> "
"on the left or the top of the extension."
msgstr "&LMB;<guibutton></guibutton> ឬ."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2245
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"I want the taskbar to show all applications I am running, independent on which "
"desktop they are. Is that possible?"
msgstr "I ដល់ ទាំងអស់ I ព្រឹក ជា?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2251
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"It is. Click the &RMB; on the small <guibutton>handle</guibutton> "
"of the taskbar, then choose <guimenuitem>Configure Taskbar...</guimenuitem> "
"and check <guilabel>Show windows from all desktops</guilabel> "
"in the appearing dialog."
msgstr "ជា ចុច&RMB;<guibutton></guibutton><guimenuitem> កំណត់​រចនាសម្ព័ន្ធ របារ​ភារកិច្ច</guimenuitem> និង<guilabel> បង្ហាញ ទាំងអស់</guilabel> អ៊ិន្ឈ៍."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2261
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid "How can I access the <guimenu>K</guimenu> Menu without using the mouse?"
msgstr "I<guimenu> K</guimenu> ម៉ឺនុយ?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2266
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Simply press <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keycap>F1</keycap></keycombo> "
"and it will appear."
msgstr "<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keycap> F1</keycap></keycombo> និង."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2275
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid "Is there a way to add a menu containing all desktop icons to &kicker;?"
msgstr "ជា a ដល់ a ទាំងអស់ រូប​តំណាង ដល់&kicker;?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2280
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Just start &konqueror;, go to your home folder and drag the <guiicon>"
"Desktop</guiicon> icon to any free space of &kicker;, then choose <guimenuitem>"
"Add as Quick Browser</guimenuitem> from the appearing menu."
msgstr "&konqueror; ដល់ និង<guiicon> ផ្ទៃតុ</guiicon> ដល់&kicker;<guimenuitem> បន្ថែម កម្មវិធី​រុករក</guimenuitem>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2291
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid "How can I change the color and style of &kicker;?"
msgstr "I និង&kicker;?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2296
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You can change the colors of the panel with the global color module of the "
"<application>Control Center</application> or you can style the panel itself, "
"see in <xref linkend=\"panel-appearance\"/> for more about that."
msgstr "អ្នក បន្ទះ <application> វត្ថុ​បញ្ជា កណ្ដាល</application> ឬ បន្ទះ  អ៊ិន្ឈ៍<xref linkend=\"panel-appearance\"/> សម្រាប់."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2306
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid "Why is the clock showing the wrong time?"
msgstr "ជា?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2311
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"On some &RedHat;systems, the clock always shows the time in &GMT;. This is a "
"bug in the system setup, and not directly related to &kicker;. However, to "
"solve it, just create this symbolic link: <userinput><command>ln</command> "
"<option>-s</option> <filename>/usr/share/zoneinfo</filename> <filename>"
"/usr/lib/zoneinfo</filename></userinput>."
msgstr "បើក&RedHat; អ៊ិន្ឈ៍&GMT; ជា a អ៊ិន្ឈ៍ និង ដល់&kicker; ដល់ តំណ<userinput><command></command><option> វិ.</option><filename></filename><filename></filename></userinput>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2324
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Is it possible to change the <guiicon>K</guiicon> button of the panel to "
"another picture?"
msgstr "ជា ដល់<guiicon> K</guiicon> បន្ទះ  ដល់?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2330
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Look for <filename>$HOME/.kde/share/apps/kicker/pics/go.png</filename> "
"and <filename>$HOME/.kde/share/apps/kicker/pics/mini/go.png</filename> "
"and replace them. Do not forget to flatten the replacements to one layer, or "
"else you will not see anything. Create the folders if they do not already "
"exist. Then restart &kicker;."
msgstr "រូបរាង សម្រាប់<filename> kicker</filename> និង<filename> kicker</filename> និង ដល់ ដល់ មួយ ឬ អ្វី​ទាំងអស់ បង្កើត&kicker;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2342
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid "Why is my <guisubmenu>Settings</guisubmenu> menu not working?"
msgstr "ជា<guisubmenu> ការ​កំណត់</guisubmenu>?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2347
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Your menu entries may be mixed up for some reason. Simply run <command>"
"kbuildsycoca</command> on a commandline."
msgstr "សម្រាប់<command></command> a."

